{"time": 1767366816, "type": "recv", "message_id": "742165674", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "302552206", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "（我们之前是在山里平原城市还是什么）"}
{"time": 1767367057, "type": "recv", "message_id": "120337743", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "302552206", "user_id": "970417396"}, "sender": {"id": "970417396", "name": "银翼"}, "message": "*然后司机让大家安静，说：“车抛锚了，这条路平时走的人也不多，我听平时走这条路的兄弟说过，这附近有个没人住的别墅，好像是房子闹鬼，租不出去，不过水电都有”"}
{"time": 1767367088, "type": "recv", "message_id": "900791659", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "302552206", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我打个电话报个警吧，大晚上的，这么浓的雾，后面的车没看到就不好了。”拿出手机，抬头问司机“先把三角牌拿出来吧”"}
{"time": 1767367129, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1199317451", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "302552206", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“闹鬼是……哪种闹鬼，凶宅？”"}
{"time": 1767367148, "type": "recv", "message_id": "551323060", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "302552206", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "摇摇头，拿出自己的大幣‌，\"看来到我的工作时间了。\""}
{"time": 1767367167, "type": "recv", "message_id": "467648214", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "302552206", "user_id": "970417396"}, "sender": {"id": "970417396", "name": "银翼"}, "message": "司机顿了顿说道：“这山里信号不好，电话也很难打出去，明天公司一早发现不对应该就会派车过来接了”"}
{"time": 1767367246, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1010878635", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "302552206", "user_id": "970417396"}, "sender": {"id": "970417396", "name": "银翼"}, "message": "“而且这山里也要天气很冷，愿意跟我去那个别墅的就跟我走，不愿意的就可能要留在车上过夜了”"}
{"time": 1767367290, "type": "recv", "message_id": "615677937", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "302552206", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“哪里的别墅？”"}
{"time": 1767367367, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1675653268", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "302552206", "user_id": "970417396"}, "sender": {"id": "970417396", "name": "银翼"}, "message": "*车上的人听到这话一群人叽叽喳喳的就要投诉，之前看起来脾气暴躁的老哥反而很冷静地问到：“你能进去那个别墅？”"}
{"time": 1767367453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "406546862", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "302552206", "user_id": "970417396"}, "sender": {"id": "970417396", "name": "银翼"}, "message": "司机：“我也不知道具体情况，只知道跑这条路的兄弟跟我说过，就在这附近，那个兄弟说垫子下边有钥匙”"}
{"time": 1767367478, "type": "recv", "message_id": "402212797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "302552206", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“远吗？”作为灵异板块的编辑，自然也不怕这个，也知道多少有点真的，不知道这个是什么情况"}
{"time": 1767367480, "type": "recv", "message_id": "298778058", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "302552206", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"啧。\"起身"}
{"time": 1767367484, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2129852450", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "302552206", "user_id": "970417396"}, "sender": {"id": "970417396", "name": "银翼"}, "message": "（那么，请选择）"}
{"time": 1767367493, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1542981077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "302552206", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(巫女肯定去)"}
{"time": 1767367496, "type": "recv", "message_id": "30026298", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "302552206", "user_id": "970417396"}, "sender": {"id": "970417396", "name": "银翼"}, "message": "（是留在车里还是跟随司机）"}
{"time": 1767367551, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1223524091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "302552206", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "起身，\"我去看看。\""}
{"time": 1767367558, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1968810187", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "302552206", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“你要去？那我也去吧”"}
{"time": 1767367567, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1472291072", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "302552206", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“司机走了的话，这里没有热源也没有灯光”"}
{"time": 1767367588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1145324130", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "302552206", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“真的要过夜的话还是去房子里吧”"}
